# DOL Starter Testing Ladder Logic

## Overview
This ladder logic provides test circuits and verification procedures for the DOL starter implementation in TIA Portal.

## Test Network 1: Start Button Test
```
      Test_Start_PB          Simulated_Start_PB
|----[ ]--------------------( )----|
|        |
|        |---------[ Test_Mode_Enable ]-------------------|
```

